{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在嘗試對Windows中最古老的系統工具之一——註冊表編輯器（Registry Editor）進行現代化改造。一款基於WinUI 3開發的全新註冊表編輯器已經出現在微軟開源項目中，不僅能夠直接讀取和修改Windows真實註冊表，還採用了Windows 11的現代化界面設計。相比之下，沿用近30年傳統佈局的regedit.exe顯得相當陳舊。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585434.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.665986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:34:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"1d5d2a67e209b0ad0a557d63785a074f52e84e1714ef85ddf4c0b60290f032e9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}